---
export interface Props {
  lang: 'pt' | 'en';
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;

const content = {
  pt: {
    overline: 'Quem te atende',
    headline: 'Victor',
    subhead: 'Massagista treinado na Tailândia, yogi formado na Índia.',
    body: [
      'Viajei pra Tailândia pra me formar como massagista na fonte da tradição. De lá fui pra Índia, onde mergulhei no yoga. Entre uma coisa e outra, vivi experiências ao redor do mundo que mudaram como eu entendo o corpo, a energia e a presença.',
      'Hoje sou o único no Brasil que oferece esse tipo de atendimento integrado: a técnica da Thai Massage tradicional somada à compreensão energética que aprendi no caminho.',
      'Atendo em Atibaia, no Espaço Clô. Em breve em Itacaré.',
    ],
    cta: 'Ler a história completa',
    ctaHref: '/sobre',
  },
  en: {
    overline: 'Who you\'ll work with',
    headline: 'Victor',
    subhead: 'Massage therapist trained in Thailand, yoga practitioner formed in India.',
    body: [
      'I traveled to Thailand to study massage at the source of the tradition. From there I went to India and immersed myself in yoga. In between, I lived experiences around the world that changed how I understand the body, energy, and presence.',
      "Today I am the only practitioner in Brazil offering this kind of integrated work: traditional Thai Massage technique combined with the energetic understanding I gathered along the way.",
      'I see clients in Atibaia, at Espaço Clô. Soon in Itacaré.',
    ],
    cta: 'Read the full story',
    ctaHref: '/en/about',
  },
};

const c = content[lang];
---

<section class="py-24 sm:py-32 bg-sand-dark/30">
  <div class="container-wide">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center">
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-2xl shadow-soft relative overflow-hidden bg-ocean-dark">
          <picture>
            <source type="image/webp" srcset="/photos/portrait.webp" />
            <img
              src="/photos/portrait.jpg"
              alt="Victor, terapeuta de massagem tailandesa em Atibaia"
              class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-top"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </picture>
        </div>
        <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 bg-terracotta rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-card hidden sm:block">
          <div class="font-display text-4xl text-sand">2500+</div>
          <div class="text-sand/90 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest2 mt-1">
            {lang === 'pt' ? 'anos de tradição' : 'years of tradition'}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div class="label-overline mb-4">{c.overline}</div>
        <h2 class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl text-ocean mb-2">{c.headline}</h2>
        <p class="font-display italic text-2xl text-ink-muted mb-8">{c.subhead}</p>
        {c.body.map(p => (
          <p class="text-ink-muted text-lg leading-relaxed mb-4">{p}</p>
        ))}
        <a href={c.ctaHref} class="btn-secondary mt-6">{c.cta}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
